      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "已接线",
      "items": [
        "POST/GET /api/projects → repositories.projects → SQLite。",
        "lifespan：initialize_database + bus.subscribe → WS broadcast。",
        "emit：SqliteTraceSink 再 EventBus.publish。",
        "SkillRegistry.create_version / transition；非法 PUBLISH 被拒。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "虚线",
      "items": [
        "Web 无 fetch/WS 客户端（App.tsx 脚手架）。",
        "无 /api/skills；Compiler（C6.7）才会调 registry。",
        "无 HTTP 调 ModelGateway；C3.6 Runtime 才会 generate。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "R4 双状态机",
      "items": [
        "domain/ 在包外左侧：类型库，被 registry.transition 使用。",
        "Pipeline ≠ SkillVersionStatus；自动终点 ≤ CANDIDATE。",
        "domain-pipeline-state.html · domain-skill-version-state.html"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
